    "Settlement helper covers response trade IDs; empty trade IDs do not prove the full order ended.",
    "balance-allowance schema does not establish complete reservation coverage.",
    "Pinned V2 fee ceiling is mutable; zero disables the check. Source defaults are not live values or immutable user fee guarantees."
